      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLEX FACTOR (8) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 2 length win at Shepparton in a handy 22.54. Outside box to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to go well again. MISS BARBIE (4) stalked the lead from a middle box and kept coming to win (24.77) at this track in Bottom Up - Grade 5 over 425m. Expecting another bold showing. RITZY RUTH (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (24.67) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here winning two races. The form out of last race has been strong. Deserves plenty of respect. HARTLAND BONNIE (7) can sneak into the finish.",
